    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "Simplify $\\dfrac{\\frac1x-1}{\\frac1x+1}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{1-x}{1+x}$, $x\\ne0,-1$.\n\nMultiply the numerator and denominator by $x$.",
      "worked": "Multiply the numerator and denominator by their common denominator, $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\frac1x-1}{\\frac1x+1}&=\\frac{x\\left(\\frac1x-1\\right)}{x\\left(\\frac1x+1\\right)}\\\\\\frac{\\frac1x-1}{\\frac1x+1}&=\\frac{1-x}{1+x}\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: $x\\ne0,-1$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
